WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:13.640
What's good, my well read ballas?!

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:18.180
This week we gonna holla, holla holla! with
Horton Hears a Who, by Dr. Seuss.

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:27.380
It’s BALLS hot up in da jungle where our
main man Horton the elephant be straight chillin.

00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:31.990
When outta nowhere- brutha start hearin’
some shit like somebody talkin to him.

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:33.020
“Da f***?

00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:35.400
Alls he see is a speck of dust!”

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.660
Turns out, he ain’t high as s***.

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:41.070
This speck got a small-a** dude livin’ all
up on it.

00:00:41.070 --> 00:00:42.070
Fo real!

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:47.471
Bein the righteous balla he is, Horton put
da spec on a clover to keep it safe- cuz no

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:52.880
matter how big o’ small people be, they
still people! S’all good ‘til some punk

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:55.280
kangaroo hops by wit her hater-ass baby.

00:00:55.290 --> 00:00:58.440
They both start talkin smack to Horton sayin
“Psh.

00:00:58.440 --> 00:01:01.600
I don’t see or hear no people on this clover.

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:03.760
You musta lost yo godd*mn mind.”

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:04.760
Then- SPLASH.

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:09.109
They jump in the pool and almost wreck dat
spec right then and there.

00:01:09.109 --> 00:01:11.189
Horton all “ Oh Hell NO!

00:01:11.189 --> 00:01:16.880
I gotz to protect my peeps” so he snatch
up dat clover, and hightail it to a safer spot.

00:01:17.020 --> 00:01:20.219
Then dude start hearin’ dat same voice from
before.

00:01:20.219 --> 00:01:25.139
This time it sayin’ there be a HOOD called
Who-ville on dat spec, and it’s full of

00:01:25.139 --> 00:01:27.759
righteous bruthas n’ sistas called Whos!

00:01:27.759 --> 00:01:29.860
The Mayor all like: “Yo Horton.

00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:32.549
Mad props fo’ watchin our back like dat
man.

00:01:32.549 --> 00:01:34.529
You bout as real as they come, playa.”

00:01:34.529 --> 00:01:38.680
When word get round dat Horton carryin’
around a flower and conversatin’ wit it

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:42.990
n’ s***, a bunch of monkeys start messin
with him and boost the clover!

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:46.950
They ain’t buyin dat da spec got people
livin’ on it, so they give the clover to

00:01:46.950 --> 00:01:52.029
a nasty ol’ eagle, who drops it in the middle
of a field so Horton won’t find it.

00:01:52.029 --> 00:01:53.700
Ain’t dat some s***?

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:58.729
Horton chases after the eagle an’ combs
through three MILLION clovers ‘til he finally

00:01:58.729 --> 00:02:01.090
finds the one wit his peoples on it.

00:02:01.090 --> 00:02:03.420
Horton ask dem Whos how they holdin up?

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:06.520
The mayor like: “Man not so good.

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:08.400
Dat fall f***ed us up BAD.”

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:13.819
Just then, dem kangaroos and monkeys roll
back to the scene, only this time wit a POSSE

00:02:13.819 --> 00:02:14.819
in tow!

00:02:14.819 --> 00:02:18.819
They tell Horton dat he stirring up s***,
so they gonna throw him in a cage while they

00:02:18.819 --> 00:02:20.250
cook up his clover!

00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:24.550
Not knowin how to prove to the haters that
his peoples exist, He tell the mayor of Who-ville:

00:02:24.550 --> 00:02:28.959
“Yo, y’all best holla’ as loud as you
can so they KNOW I ain’t fakin’” But

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:31.220
the mob can’t hear fo’ s***.

00:02:31.220 --> 00:02:33.250
So the Whos take it up a notch.

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:37.920
They straight raise the ROOF; clangin’ pots
an’ bangin’ tunes to make themselves heard,

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:39.720
but it ain’t cuttin it!

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:41.080
Now Horton is buggin!

00:02:41.080 --> 00:02:43.950
So he ask the mayor if anybody holdin out.

00:02:43.950 --> 00:02:49.159
Turns out- there’s one dude wastin’ everyone’s
time wit a damn yo-yo!

00:02:49.159 --> 00:02:54.590
So da mayor get this young blood to haul ass
up a tower an’ give a live-saving hollar!”

00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:55.590
HOLLAAAAAAAAA!

00:02:55.590 --> 00:02:57.700
The little thug lets out a “Yopp!”, an’
BOOOOOOM!

00:02:57.700 --> 00:03:01.319
The mob hear every-thang! Horton say: “See!

00:03:01.319 --> 00:03:02.849
I wasn’t jivin’ you!

00:03:02.849 --> 00:03:04.870
These tiny people are fo-real!”

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:07.359
The kangaroo says: “Damn, son.

00:03:07.359 --> 00:03:08.359
You was right!”

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:14.269
Afta dat, all da animal homies come together
and swear to protect da Whos.

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:21.440
Errybody in da hood know Doc Seuss fo’ his
mad skillz at writin kids books.

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:26.629
But you might NOT know that he also got cred
fo’ writin’ political cartoons during

00:03:26.629 --> 00:03:27.629
WW2.

00:03:27.629 --> 00:03:31.849
So there ain’t no doubt Seuss got da war
and its victims on on his mind when writin’

00:03:31.849 --> 00:03:36.329
bout how important it is to protect ERRYBODY-
no matter who they be:

00:03:36.329 --> 00:03:38.499
“A person's a person, no matter how small!

00:03:38.499 --> 00:03:41.379
And you very small persons will not have to
die.

00:03:41.379 --> 00:03:42.909
If you make yourselves heard!

00:03:42.909 --> 00:03:45.000
So come on, now, and TRY!”

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:49.680
Matta’ fact, this book dropped right afta’
dat s*** storm ended and countries started

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:52.030
pickin’ up the pieces- specially Japan.

00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:56.930
Some say Horton representing how America was
super chill bout helpin Japan build their

00:03:56.930 --> 00:03:59.930
s*** back up afta’ da war left em busted.

00:03:59.930 --> 00:04:06.239
Da whos reppin the Japanese, whereas dem hater @ss
animals actin like dem relentless peeps who

00:04:06.239 --> 00:04:08.030
wanted REVENGE against da Japanese.

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:13.189
And when you faced with people who wanna do
you like dat, ERRY VOICE – even the tiniest

00:04:13.189 --> 00:04:15.599
ones – got the power to make a difference.

00:04:15.599 --> 00:04:21.030
It’s only when EVERY Who got off their a**es
and hollered that da hood got saved.

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:26.550
No matta’ how small you feel, you got legit
power when you band together with yo homies.

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:44.201
Ain’t no doubt standin up fo yo beliefs
is rough, but doing it alone take a special

00:04:44.201 --> 00:04:45.700
set of balls.

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:51.290
Horton just ONE hustla tryin to convince a
whole BAND of jabronis that Whos are LEGIT.

00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:57.560
They even throw his a** behind bars, but Horton
keep it 100 and sticks by his principles.

00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:00.230
And thats whats it mean to have REAL balls, man.

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:05.230
Lord knows there still plenty of little folk
out there who need help, and it ain’t always

00:05:05.230 --> 00:05:06.580
easy to do right by em.

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:12.260
But you CAN’T let the haters keep you down,
cuz no matter how bunk yo situation be, you got a voice,

00:05:12.260 --> 00:05:13.580
and it matters.

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:17.620
So neva’ back down on yo values 
and make yo’self HEARD!

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:20.840
Ya heard? Yo, thanks for stoppin by my library.

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:24.760
See y’all next time, Playas! Peace!

